{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_title", "source_sha256": "6aaf0c256b4ae2217db513cb7f2c975c204d10c6ba3e6ff7f4a5aca7c4b17dae", "ja": "晴れやかな気持ちで", "zh": "怀着爽朗的心情", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_synopsis", "source_sha256": "ec0fda6a6d5d4c8e0a8cfbb7ef8471c1bb06d949e9c4b6ba040810869fd490f4", "ja": "無事に千秋楽を迎え、打ち上げに来た\n昴、亜利沙、可憐、千鶴、紗代子。\nお互いにねぎらいつつ、打ち上げの\n予約時間になるまで、みんなで公園を\n散歩することに。", "zh": "平安迎来最终场，昴、亚利沙、可怜、千鹤和纱代子来到庆功宴。\n大家互相慰劳，并决定在庆功宴预约的时间到来前，一起在公园散步。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1000_p", "source_sha256": "762b7c920446e13bc3e161315efb0cdaa1c0e31d77a946a21dbe8e06ba9ddce4", "ja": "（『STARDOM ROAD』第三幕公演は\n温かな拍手に包まれ、千秋楽を迎えた……）", "zh": "（《STARDOM ROAD》第三幕的演出被温暖的掌声包围，迎来了最终场……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1001_p", "source_sha256": "5b2c8b6125240d15b48a92860e9456d12a5260f9d4ed7ac6def32fd79792c1b7", "ja": "（今日の打ち上げは、上野の老舗洋食店。\n頑張ったみんなを労ってあげないとな！）", "zh": "（今天的庆功宴是在上野的老字号西餐馆。得好好慰劳一下努力过的大家才行！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1002_027say", "source_sha256": "282788c8f778d0d607a7dc94aa29ede16594081757efd28af5a5920d6b7cad5f", "ja": "私達の第三幕も、好評だったみたいだね……！\n本当によかったぁ……。", "zh": "我们的第三幕演出好像也得到了好评……！真的太好了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1003_027say", "source_sha256": "90df274617b155b26b3f01d4d97c0770ef91f5dd1e345b4e82f14738ddbb36ab", "ja": "演技のニュアンスや方向性……みんなで\n目いっぱい話し合った事が、結果に繋がったね！", "zh": "演技的细节和方向……大家一起尽情讨论过的那些事，最终都转化成成果了呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "be376a2abcf0110bc73f297490e333e230649b8bafe526c908850835fd74fdc0", "ja": "オレは、紗代子がレッスンの相手してくれて\nすっげー助かったぜ！", "zh": "有紗代子陪我练习，真是帮了大忙！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "14d9460f342c564327c185dfb173cc13ce88328a3539a18f3e06d4546ae15f04", "ja": "誰かがいなくても、紗代子が他の役を\nやってくれたからさ。", "zh": "就算少了谁，紗代子也会帮忙演其他角色啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "8af2f73ed136bd064d8b4e2d2a29650b1a5321165d2b40cd4a55c632ff4c76b6", "ja": "う、うん。台詞も全部、完璧で……\n私も、たくさん相手をしてもらっちゃった……♪", "zh": "嗯、嗯。台词也全都记得一字不差……\n我也让她陪我对了好多遍……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1007_038chz", "source_sha256": "2b376462ed9ffbb507767ffbcc10e6fef3c201b8ed856bfb9280d8d60298141d", "ja": "紗代子は、毎日誰かの相手をしていましたものね。\n台詞もそうですけど、演技も達者で。", "zh": "纱代子每天都在陪别人对戏呢。不光是台词，演技也相当出色。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1008_028ari", "source_sha256": "58171b91b89ab7a1430b393ec49f44285230fa05bbfcfc17f9381e50b6a3acf5", "ja": "最後は、全員の台詞を覚えちゃってましたからね……\n紗代子ちゃんの情熱、恐るべしです！", "zh": "到最后，她把所有人的台词都记下来了……\n纱代子的热情，真是令人叹服！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1009_027say", "source_sha256": "acf8c48f9798ff7fc63fceed4c6863b42affec9a192aba086cff4d5684c10c55", "ja": "そんな事ないよ。それに私だって、千鶴さんの\nアドバイスがほしくて、色々聞いちゃったし……。", "zh": "没那回事啦。而且我也很想听听千鹤小姐的建议，所以不知不觉问了好多事情……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1010_038chz", "source_sha256": "a3e779f47a429f66db85fbc477a38d745e4c48981318da60ccd959aea37f2370", "ja": "わたくしから助言したことなんて、\nほんのささいなことですわ。", "zh": "我给出的那些建议，\n不过是些微不足道的小事罢了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1022_027say", "source_sha256": "8da1c188a1432926809d6db0465eef3a0e2873ef97ef41eeb3c42d21f365d7b5", "ja": "でも、すごく助かりましたから！\n千鶴さん、本当にありがとうございました。", "zh": "不过，真的帮了我大忙！千鹤小姐，真的非常感谢您。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1011_027say", "source_sha256": "c6a3ef11b1563ad52d31455ef5322394ebd64023f36fdc8ce09c60f02bb68b52", "ja": "真珠星、なる、クロエ……みんな、アイドルに\nなりたい気持ちが強い子達ばっかりで、楽しかったな。", "zh": "珍珠星、鸣、克洛伊……她们全都是非常渴望成为偶像的孩子，真的很开心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1012_027say", "source_sha256": "2ff828e97e2ca85cc22d2bf5eadfbc00c24b9d98755f4064f585c5ee7c27ba55", "ja": "アイドルになりたい気持ちなら、私は、誰よりも\n理解できるはず……。そう思って、頑張りました！", "zh": "想成为偶像的心情，我应该比任何人都更能理解……我是这么想的，所以努力了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1013_p", "source_sha256": "dd53c7865f7972ea75c3faa266f919c34f68157c7113383a04f14f19ba5f920d", "ja": "なるほどな。紗代子の支えがあっての、\n第三幕の好評だったってことだな。ありがとう。", "zh": "原来如此。有了纱代子的支持，第三幕才能广受好评啊。谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1014_p", "source_sha256": "e4a4c96a7b0cd976f8cce44d25de973173680b47ea1c1bda464fd8200189dba2", "ja": "みんな、今日はとびきりのお店を予約してるから、\n期待してくれていいぞ！", "zh": "大家，我今天订了一家特别棒的店，\n尽管好好期待吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1015_047sub", "source_sha256": "6d4a325c527bfa0ab394ff86cebea49bcbd48c7ec180a164d11ab1813fab7b2a", "ja": "やったー！　あ、でもまだ時間あるんだろ？\nだったら、公園の中、散歩していかない？", "zh": "太好啦——！啊，不过时间还早对吧？\n那要不要去公园里散散步？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1016_027say", "source_sha256": "237fdee1014c23e699be7df370480c9a5eadce53c26dee4a957b3fecf819551d", "ja": "いいね！　お天気が良くて散歩日和だし、\nお腹も空きそうだね♪", "zh": "好主意！今天天气这么好，正适合散步，\n而且散完步肚子应该也会饿呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1017_038chz", "source_sha256": "189702a8863d5ecdf92b7e117b42c6629b13ab17224897a917db682f013dfba5", "ja": "ならみんなで、\n公園を一周してから向かいましょうか。", "zh": "那我们大家先绕公园走一圈，再过去吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "b0d7d5eddf0339be11ddc5abc748f0b0f2a747f3f6b309e67c989e51144ac0f4", "ja": "いい景観に、アイドルちゃん……絵になりますね！\nありさも賛成です！", "zh": "美丽的景色，再加上偶像们……真是赏心悦目呢！\n有栖也赞成！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1019_045kar", "source_sha256": "1582c7deecd70ffcfdc3f5d0763d64c6a7123b428b9db399a0232cb17938be87", "ja": "あったかくていい匂いの中、みんなと、\n{$P$}さんとお散歩……えへへ……♪", "zh": "在温暖又好闻的空气中，和大家，\n还有{$P$}先生一起散步……嘿嘿……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1020_p", "source_sha256": "90749e3d0f7e482486f83ecd7ed945d8494ac328be29d2668b20bdd79c285735", "ja": "（『STARDOM ROAD』第一幕から第三幕、\nひとまずの区切りを迎えられたな）", "zh": "（《STARDOM ROAD》第一幕到第三幕，\n总算告一段落了）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_07_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_07_1021_p", "source_sha256": "6d541679a4bce60908d55252c67ee3411b6d5dc8e4ede4bb263e2d6e4d8a60d0", "ja": "（次は新章……みんなで繋いでいく物語、\nこの先にどんな景色が広がっているか、楽しみだ！）", "zh": "（接下来是新的篇章……这是一个由大家共同串联起来的故事，不知道前方会展现出怎样的景色，真让人期待啊！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
